- Stack implemented here is **Array-based** (fixed size).  
- If you want **dynamic size**, you use **Linked List** implementation of stack.  
- Interviewers often ask **applications of stack**:  
  - Expression evaluation (infix → postfix)  
  - Undo/Redo in text editors  
  - Function call stack in programming  

